{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Popteenは\nもうチェックしていただけましたか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/10/06/8094218/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回は、\nまあやと\nハロウィンメイク企画のコーナーにいます。\nいっぱいコスプレして\nハロウィンメイクして楽しかった～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/10/06/8094218/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/10/06/8094218/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初Furyuさんにもおじゃましました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好きな\nなみっきーさんメイクで幸せ～。\n可愛いを作る神様！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハロウィン何しよ～？って思ってる子は\nぜひ参考にしてほしい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/10/06/8094218/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"プチプラで簡単なメイクなのに\nクオリティ高いのo(｡･‧̫･｡)o"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなめろくんが、\n\"恥ずかしくて買えない～\"\nといわれるんですが、\n家族の分または妹に頼まれたと\n思って買えばよゆう！\nそれか、ネットでかう！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/10/06/8094218/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンケートに\n川後って毎月書いてくれてる子がいて嬉しい\nそういうのも大事だから、\nみんなに感謝！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今月も宜しくお願いします"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/10/06/8094218/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/10/06/8094218/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/10/06/8094218/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2016年も残り3ヶ月、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"怖い"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前あけおめブログ書いた気がするよ、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":":(´◦ω◦｀):"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年のうちに\nやりたい事を考えてみた。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/10/06/8094218/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"魚料理\n最近けっこうお魚好きだから、\n肉料理以外にも挑戦したいなと。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/10/06/8094218/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"映画を沢山みる\nみたい映画沢山あるから\n時間見つけてみよう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/10/06/8094218/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"秋冬物の服集める\n系統が若干かわってきていて、\n去年の好みとかわってるの！\n真っ白コートとかかいたい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/10/06/8094218/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"けど基本服は黒がすき～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/10/06/8094218/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"グラビアを凄くやりたい\n18歳なって大人の色気出てきたと思ってるんで\nどこかの雑誌関係者様！！！！！\nわたしにグラビアのチャンスを！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/10/06/8094218/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"可愛くとってもらいたいし、\nインタビューされたいし"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/10/06/8094218/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"欲"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スピリッツ、UTB、BUBKA、BOMB、BLT、EX大衆、ヤングマガジン、ヤングジャンプ、週刊プレイボーイ、ヤングチャンピオン、カドカワ、overture、topyell、週刊少年ジャンプ、週刊少年マガジン、月刊エンタメ、ヤングガンガン、BRODY、週刊少年サンデー、ヤングアニマル、、、うわあ出たいのいっぱい。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/10/06/8094218/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/10/06/8094218/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつか制覇....したい....."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/10/06/8094218/0013.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/10/06/8094218/0014.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(中身入ってない）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回のブログに\n川後好みのアーティストを\nコメントで答えてくれてありがとう～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"戸川純さんと女王蜂さん、\nBiSHさん、ZAZENBOYSさん、人間椅子さん、相対性理論さん、カラスは真っ白さん、パスピエさん、神聖かまってちゃんさん、筋肉少女帯さん、アーバンギャルドさん、ドレスコーズさん、クリープハイプさん、オカモトズさん、SHEISSUMMERさん、生ハムと焼きうどんさんなどなど、、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"陽菜の趣味よく分かってるなあ、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"同じ方をオススメだよって\n被ってたりしたから、\n川後が好きそうなやつってコレだな\nってのがバレバレなんですね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/10/06/8094218/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実はオススメしてくれた\n7割ほどが仮に知っていて\n好きという自体（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"知らないものは\nすぐ調べて聞いてみました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/10/06/8094218/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"凄く良い！！って思うの沢山で流石です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/10/06/8094218/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/10/06/8094218/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとう！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、\nいつも、コメントありがとう、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばいぴち。"}],"source":"archive"}